      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792770993805,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1 epoch = one pass over all 40 examples.\nYour notebook runs 1,000 epochs.\n\nL1Loss averages the absolute errors.\nSGD makes small parameter updates.\n\nOnly two numbers are learned:\nweight ~ 0.7 and bias ~ 0.3.",
      "originalText": "1 epoch = one pass over all 40 examples.\nYour notebook runs 1,000 epochs.\n\nL1Loss averages the absolute errors.\nSGD makes small parameter updates.\n\nOnly two numbers are learned:\nweight ~ 0.7 and bias ~ 0.3.",
      "fontSize": 21,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    },
